35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The log shows one house filed eleven of fourteen complaints. That is a lot of noise.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The station block's bin house smells worse than the open pile. Their minutes show they argue now.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Supervised mornings take fifty minutes. The truck comes at seven forty. That is very early for some.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,Two frontages are too narrow for a bay. One has a driveway. The space is not equal.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The subsidy covers forty percent, capped. Last year's shelters cost two hundred forty-eight thousand average.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if the space is uneven, rotating might be impossible. We need a fixed spot.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, waking up before seven is hard. I worry about the early mornings for everyone.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, yes. If the window is tight, it is a burden. I prefer a structure that handles it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, a fixed spot means one house suffers. I still want fairness, even if it is hard.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, the cost is high. We need to know if the ward helps with the build.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The filing requirements say a permanent build takes four months. That is a long wait.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, four months is long, but a bad smell is worse. I want a clean solution.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, the subsidy is capped. We still pay sixty percent. That is a lot for five houses.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if we pay, we should decide who pays what. I want a clear ledger.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the ledger shows thirty-four thousand a year in extra fees. We must stop the waste.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
