60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Option A is a permanent enclosure. It takes four months, but it stops the smell.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option B is rotating. But the frontages are uneven. It might not work for everyone.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option C is managed hours. But the truck comes early. It is a heavy burden on the overseers.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A seems best for fairness if we share the cost. Option B is too messy.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option A is the most stable. The subsidy helps, but we must budget for the rest.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, I agree. A permanent structure is better than moving it around.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I am worried about the cost, but I want a clean corner. I lean towards A.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, the cost is high, but the hours are lower than C. I can accept A.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if we split the cost fairly, I am in. I want to end the gate issue.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, let us vote. A seems the most durable and fair if we manage the money well.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I vote for A. It solves the smell and the complaints.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I vote for A. I want a peaceful, clean corner for the summer.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for A. It is the most logical long-term solution despite the cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I vote for A. It is the only one that feels truly equal in the long run.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I vote for A. It is the wise choice for our shared future.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
